# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only what the image needs.
# This keeps real participant data (pilot-data/, dev-docs/google-forms/), research
# docs, analysis scripts, tests and local .env files out of the build context entirely.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!src/

# Never ship env files, even if one is added under src/ later.
**/.env
**/.env.*
